{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Binomial_Expansion)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Binomial Expansion)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Characteristic_Polynomials)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Characteristic Polynomials)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the units digit of the decimal expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/37278df376055897e1132e53b5a6d5bb9a92c3b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{19} + \\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{82}.\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da3bc708e7b194e88616e97bf33834530cae74f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 9\\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"435\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Binomial_Expansion.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Binomial_Expansion)\">Solution 1 (Binomial Expansion)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Binomial Expansion)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22e806cc5a3bfcb119e2a2f3e629cc8dbde6693b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=15+\\sqrt{220}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"123\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/4/cf41bb21206b87983099b5d905a0b8bf1d5b91b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=15-\\sqrt{220}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"21\" /> Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c51f5e395c50ce6512df16cb2f783d76b880d44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^{19}+B^{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/3/48308be8fbe8762ffa1e29b723de60848ce6a3e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^{82}+B^{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /> are both integers: When we expand (Binomial Theorem) and combine like terms for each expression, the rational terms are added and the irrational terms are canceled.\n</p><p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/610cddd7533db2a51af9b1215cafb15fb4a3316c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} A^{19}+B^{19} &amp;= \\left[\\binom{19}{0}15^{19}\\sqrt{220}^0+\\binom{19}{1}15^{18}\\sqrt{220}^1+\\cdots+\\binom{19}{19}15^0\\sqrt{220}^{19}\\right] + \\left[\\binom{19}{0}15^{19}\\sqrt{220}^0-\\binom{19}{1}15^{18}\\sqrt{220}^1+\\cdots-\\binom{19}{19}15^0\\sqrt{220}^{19}\\right] \\\\ &amp;= 2\\left[\\binom{19}{0}15^{19}\\sqrt{220}^0+\\binom{19}{2}15^{17}\\sqrt{220}^2+\\cdots+\\binom{19}{18}15^1\\sqrt{220}^{18}\\right] \\\\ &amp;= 2\\left[\\binom{19}{0}15^{19}+\\binom{19}{2}15^{17}220+\\cdots+\\binom{19}{18}15^1 220^9\\right]. \\end{align*}\" width=\"1107\" height=\"173\" />\nSimilarly, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/8/cd881081663aca7c6a37d65789bc1c476ac7361b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A^{82}+B^{82}=2\\left[\\binom{82}{0}15^{82}+\\binom{82}{2}15^{80}220+\\cdots+\\binom{82}{82}220^{41}\\right].\\]\" width=\"493\" height=\"53\" />\nWe add the two equations and take the sum modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84f16e66e03c7df88b01a210cfdddb7fe1b5f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/673270b8d6448f672380d0c8f41c0f6da0dae43b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\left(A^{19}+A^{82}\\right)+\\left(B^{19}+B^{82}\\right) &amp;= 2\\Biggl[\\binom{19}{0}15^{19}+\\phantom{ }\\underbrace{\\binom{19}{2}15^{17}220+\\cdots+\\binom{19}{18}15^1 220^9}_{0\\pmod{10}}\\phantom{ }\\Biggr]+2\\Biggl[\\binom{82}{0}15^{82}+\\phantom{ }\\underbrace{\\binom{82}{2}15^{80}220+\\cdots+\\binom{82}{82}220^{41}}_{0\\pmod{10}}\\phantom{ }\\Biggr] \\\\ &amp;\\equiv 2\\left[\\binom{19}{0}15^{19}\\right]+2\\left[\\binom{82}{0}15^{82}\\right] \\\\ &amp;\\equiv 2\\left[5\\right]+2\\left[5\\right] \\\\ &amp;\\equiv 0\\pmod{10}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"1062\" height=\"191\" />\nIt is clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/006503f07935dcc0110dbe608d3d13796d804478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;B^{82}&lt;B^{19}&lt;B&lt;0.5,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"20\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/2/7a208837987a3c3e9351a47fc7152da5a6082d2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;B^{19}+B^{82}&lt;1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" /> We conclude that the units digit of the decimal expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45a8292871540728968f6e6d91568e5d8e5a8b81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B^{19}+B^{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/604c735470dd0152ca1cff75fe26eadf5cef7f49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> Since the units digit of the decimal expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd0383ff2c800ecd061e4544eb523d21c4818a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(A^{19}+A^{82}\\right)+\\left(B^{19}+B^{82}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"214\" height=\"23\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced6b9b2e75857b566f1e516560c4a4d63977299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> the units digit of the decimal expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbfc49fd24d5408582a2b901ece2a36404930fd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^{19}+A^{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/1/cf1366948d925651f5c761ae3d09f9a8d0158dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"62\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Characteristic_Polynomials.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Characteristic_Polynomials)\">Solution 2 (Characteristic Polynomials)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Characteristic Polynomials)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbd70619d65b00b9729a7229eda50a84ef90afa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^n + \\left(15 - \\sqrt{220}\\right)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"293\" height=\"35\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01a245cc3f1a170b3a1020da7f41872736cb2d2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right) + \\left(15 - \\sqrt{220}\\right) = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"275\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d45877f03dff3231c952d2df0e1134fb67f745f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)\\left(15 - \\sqrt{220}\\right) = 225 - 220 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"347\" height=\"34\" />, by Vieta's rules, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f5278b8ca89c78acc1c940a809e44f92532ff9fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 + \\sqrt{220}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d6dfff18e279b85948fc8ca67139947e609bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\sqrt{220}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"21\" /> are roots of the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/7/eb73e9b6ff1bd0cab5231cf0f1e555cac8168a76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - 30x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" />.  This must be the characteristic polynomial of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" />, and therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/9/3e9b5144a4f5c21ab9cf86a28538b86690dc5513.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n} = 30a_{n-1} - 5a_{n-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/72287b09043ed45b372a517d764e12d07aff8071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef1d3c460fbb3ef5d0ef615bf1597402a1cea3a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc318b5cac7aecfcf3a8fdca96488c25313614a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d66cc742f00458506b4e519015233dcd11e8ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = 30 \\cdot 30 - 5 \\cdot 2 = 890$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"17\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/572b65ebc3f438b176b4ca4a890799f2f72564af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> must also be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.  By similar logic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> for every integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578cf6c5b8058f6f8e6369416da6dcaf73f8fc01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b7f2d56ed968814ef4700611f5fefc9254fa00a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{19} + a_{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/e/b0ee7aa4e297f581bf07188e282c2eef00c5452b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\sqrt{220} &lt; 15 - \\sqrt{210.25} = 15 - 14.5 = 0.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"359\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0faf6c096a5d4854d280564e3ca1c4249bf9113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(15 - \\sqrt{220}\\right)^n &lt; (0.5)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"186\" height=\"35\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca922d6a8dcf87cc9528d8e5d74de2a2941c57be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\left(15 - \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{19} + \\left(15 - \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"295\" height=\"37\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/60483d9584f1c1dd8bf1e69d398458b27722a068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; (0.5)^{19} + (0.5)^{82} &lt; 0.5 + 0.5 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"288\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/89019fbb5fb9785f1fcd36954b381abe35d3f6d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{19} + \\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{82} = a_{19} + a_{82} - x &gt; a_{19} + a_{82} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"512\" height=\"37\" />, so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6ddc27fa60b1044195b990654b05bc14116cd60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{19} + \\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"260\" height=\"37\" /> must be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb009e1fd8b36017cf07f0dca352af43a165ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{19}+a_{82}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43c69d5894a1d4dd9f185f4f33217c468fe8fbcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{19}+a_{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b7f2d56ed968814ef4700611f5fefc9254fa00a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{19} + a_{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb009e1fd8b36017cf07f0dca352af43a165ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{19}+a_{82}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43c69d5894a1d4dd9f185f4f33217c468fe8fbcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{19}+a_{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus the decimal expansion of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6ddc27fa60b1044195b990654b05bc14116cd60f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{19} + \\left(15 + \\sqrt{220}\\right)^{82}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"260\" height=\"37\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/0063e6c7a6e104b60b3357655c87c797af745252.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\mathbf{D})\\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" ti